The 2024–25 season was the 105th season in the history of the [[CA Osasuna]] and the club's sixth consecutive season in [[2024–25 La Liga|La Liga]]. In addition to the domestic league, the team participated in the [[Copa del Rey]].

On 27 May 2024, Osasuna announced [[Vicente Moreno]] as the new coach.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.marca.com/futbol/osasuna/2024/05/27/66544997e2704e76ba8b45c4.html|title=Vicente Moreno, nuevo entrenador de Osasuna|date=May 27, 2024|website=MARCA}}</ref>

